QUESTIONS
1. Data quality (do first)
    How many businesses are Exempt, Awaiting Inspection, or truly NULL, and what share of the dataset is that?
    Which business types have the most Exempt or Awaiting Inspection businesses?
    After excluding Exempt, Awaiting Inspection and nulls, how many businesses remain for analysis?
2. Baseline
    What is the overall distribution of ratings across Reading (count and % for each rating from 0 to 5)?
    What is the average overall rating, and the average hygiene, structural and confidence in management penalty scores (lower is better for these three)?
3. Best and worst business types
    Which business types have the highest proportion of “Very good” ratings and the highest average overall score (minimum 20 businesses)?
    Which business types have the highest proportion rated below “Generally satisfactory” (2 or less), and the lowest average overall score (minimum 20 businesses)?
    Which business types have the best (lowest) average hygiene, structural and confidence in management scores?
    Which business types have the worst (highest) average hygiene, structural and confidence in management scores?
4. Chains and multiple branches
    Which business names appear more than once (e.g. 3 or more branches)?
    For those, how consistent are the ratings across branches (min, max, average, spread)?
    When a business name appears in the top or bottom performers, do its other branches have similar or opposite ratings?
5. Geography
    Where are the businesses rated 2 or below?
    Which areas or postcodes have the lowest and highest average scores?
    Where are the Exempt and Awaiting Inspection businesses?
  

